      "updated": 1730025546015,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 15.173635471608735,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Creates a per-part assessment of the different parts of\nthe CV. For instance, it assesses the relevance of each\nstatement to the job posting by assigning a score.\n\nPotentially alternative statements related to each job \nexperience are graded for selection or filtering out \nin later stages. ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Creates a per-part assessment of the different parts of\nthe CV. For instance, it assesses the relevance of each\nstatement to the job posting by assigning a score.\n\nPotentially alternative statements related to each job \nexperience are graded for selection or filtering out \nin later stages. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
